i": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622192_926880037153049_3310627298817883057_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n5vbC1Um_cQQ7kNvwEUuYav&_nc_oc=AdoIKsfXYOn5gUQViRy4W09KXcVzdq8wlpUepG_yWb02RTcOEKa_WY-Ax19RLkGY6nY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRAIdEYVWPTO2Q09oK8sWisUwxbhXJlRaH_OmDzO5eqdQ&oe=6AFDAE60"}, {"file_name": "ss3_2.png", "id": "1747044096547084", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626728_1747044099880417_7174878183584050592_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLOeN0m-JZ0Q7kNvwHlvtGU&_nc_oc=AdqFcBuv5qO4U-nDEWhhZ966UprrtebcvydrTlthcdL-F3v0yVamOyr28DKOI2_VXqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTkgTKgNDolEz-k0y8OKc95aWvrGj7ap76JwBnVheUfZw&oe=6AFDD02C"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "2095325167779051", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593723055_2095325174445717_3767497110148615309_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yPT1skNFuSoQ7kNvwELVMNH&_nc_oc=AdqiRlVOI2jaQ0Nrdi2o1hH6AT4KwisIlCg9jniMvdJ7tmcq8wbVZ4nRy3xDk3aY0a8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSu9-dLXKAYN4iZi29wGkAIjPmHEwmGLwzVCNcsxc9JlQ&oe=6AFDD6FD"}, {"file_name": "ss1_2.png", "id": "4578559449040187", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499626728_4578559452373520_6188292513961274461_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MGCz2iXBF74Q7kNvwEPlpVh&_nc_oc=AdoZWiUROhtBherfA_XPy6dJV-FrgejpzznS9CLbgXLdxWsD17LyGeNUEt-e1CJ0ras&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSkvN7RylPvoLV4fDE_yqo-VaEUUY5SVLHGqPyxLxqZkw&oe=6AFDE551"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizard Horror VR: Magic Spell Survival", "keywords": ["horror", "wizard", "magic", "zombie", "escape"], "long_description": "Wizard Horror VR: Magic Spell Survival is a VR horror, magic, spell casting, escape room, and survival horror adventure for Meta Quest. Become a wizard on a vengeance mission with a magic wand, explore haunted rooms, fight zombies and monsters, collect potions, unlock cabinets, find hidden keys, and escape a cursed mansion.\n\nYou were once part of a powerful magical order. A cursed enemy attacked your sanctuary, stole your magic stones, and vanished into a haunted building packed with dark rooms, locked doors, cursed souls, zombie ambushes, and terrifying creatures. Now you enter alone, armed with your wand and a burning need for vengeance.\n\nUse your VR hands to search rooms, open drawers, unlock cupboards, inspect shelves, and collect hidden items. Find blue, red, purple, and green magic stones, then match each stone with its potion to charge your wand and cast different spells. Every potion, key, cabinet, and door brings you closer to the enemy who stole your power.\n\nSurvive mission-based horror levels built around room-to-room exploration, escape room objectives, magic combat, wand combat, potion hunting, and monster fights. Some enemies attack directly, while others hide in darkness.\n\nThe Cursed Keeper appears throughout the haunted building, then runs. He locks doors, triggers zombie attacks, and always stays just out of reach. Hunt him across 10 dark missions, uncover the truth behind the curse, restore your magic, complete your vengeance, and finish the mission.", "short_description": "Wizard Horror VR: Magic Spell Survival is a VR horror, magic, spell casting, escape room, and survival horror adventure for Meta Quest. Enter haunted rooms as a wizard on a vengeance mission. Use your magic wand, collect potions and magic stones, unlock cabinets, find hidden keys, and fight zombies, monsters, and cursed creatures. Cast spells, survive dark rooms, hunt the Cursed Keeper, and escape the cursed mansion before your stolen magic is lost forever."}]}, "developer_name": null, 